==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Weavile|61}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Weavile|86}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*{{m|Slash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Weavile}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

